{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4960e0113b39c867607590ce2a39ae4e0592e62ec95d09c4300276b68f2a5808", "ja": "（『Starlight Melody!』公演は大成功。\n大盛り上がりのまま舞台の幕が下りた！）", "zh": "（『Starlight Melody!』公演十分成功，\n在一片盛况之中圆满落幕了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1001_p", "source_sha256": "634db870d2533eb06e023dffdf6cef792ba12f85d08533e7ae37c64f2007ea68", "ja": "星梨花、お疲れさま。みんなの一体感があって温かい、\nとてもいいステージになったな。", "zh": "星梨花，辛苦你们了。\n大家默契十足，是场温暖又精采的表演喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "716dce0b838f5e2aecb42d71c6dbe1caccd66c1201b7edb1c860082b7a6e4cb4", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪　きっと、お星さまを\nみなさんと一緒に見に行ったおかげですね。", "zh": "谢谢制作人♪\n这一定是托了之前和大家一起去看星星的福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "bf0a7de577d15b3eb83a5f35efffe483705d73394e6c8a5b5d029e07b9995a4e", "ja": "{$P$}さん。わたし達、\nお星さまみたいに、キラキラできてましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n我们有像星星一样闪闪发亮吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e4170e9f83a2f1c15510ebf21ace86e2c08c704a1b41dbece85e9708372b89d6", "ja": "もちろん。客席も盛り上がったし、\nみんな、ステージでキラキラに輝いてたよ！", "zh": "那当然，观众反应也很热烈，\n大家在舞台上都很闪耀喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "5eef8b32874bbc29175401e3063acc78181b71aee4c5306f7d84a3c2ab40ddc1", "ja": "わあ……！\nえへへ、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "哇……！\n嘿嘿，谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1006_p", "source_sha256": "782dccdf428a818f9d3b2904014ff50bd31fdc2e4d08e0dcc3f9b35f0f6276e0", "ja": "でも盛り上がりすぎて、少し時間が押しちゃったな。\n遅くならないように早く帰り支度を……。", "zh": "不过观众太过热情，耽搁了一点时间。\n赶快准备回去吧，免得时间太晚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "560b5be2fc1253f50cb78ea6b58c71ff50b44a4421bd6916beb48e0c2fe45e64", "ja": "はい。……あの、{$P$}さん。\nその前にちょっとだけ……いいですか？", "zh": "好的……那个，{$P$}先生。\n在那之前……可以先等一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ababcb4da40bf400a8229372fc4fca677514afeb1e5d82d0a86f593da7273a9f", "ja": "うん？　どうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "c63b4679569afa4ee862726369e4c91f7ac0c4a7d51b8d56689bb858dbe94be1", "ja": "えっと……あっ、見えます！\nやっぱり、ここからでもお星さまが見えるんですね！", "zh": "呃……啊，看到了！\n这里果然也看得到星星呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1011_p", "source_sha256": "28ab22867ad7b67b64e0164d1110814a54e243f294dfc89bfe8eda0fac149efe", "ja": "そうだな……うっすらと、だけど。\nやっぱりここは、星を見るにはちょっと明るすぎるか。", "zh": "是啊……虽然只是隐隐约约而已。\n这里要看星星还是太亮了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "74a6076a6b609b6ab7f192b5b1642b7cc5b89bdd29af8569fdd514a37e8e2846", "ja": "そうですね……山の上で見たのと比べると、\nちょっぴり寂しいです……。", "zh": "对呀……跟山上看到的星星相比，\n显得有点寂寞呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "780069d0fbb59c100e652769d2dc5f0ecdf4dfddbc56b72963f39dbd1d76f08a", "ja": "でも、わたし、\nここから見えるお星さまも大好きです！", "zh": "不过，\n我也很喜欢在这里看的星星！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "910afe712df60e5e809cc8c84a8b63e062a4ad9fcfbed73149a30779ff602d9f", "ja": "だって、わたし達の劇場から見える、\nわたし達のお星さまですから♪", "zh": "因为，这是在我们的剧场看到的，\n专属于我们的星星啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1cb375d883fb4891997390551bd753afb371e2a58b132399d024841058544bda", "ja": "……なるほど。確かにこの星空は、\nここからしか見えない、ここにしかない星空だ。", "zh": "……原来如此。\n这片星空确实只有这里能看见，是专属于这里的星空。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "2fd5de99f178d25ec62d5cdedc7094377fe7daad6e56e3da7e6d00517681d341", "ja": "あれっ？　{$P$}さん、\n下を歩いてるのは、劇場から帰るお客さん達ですか？", "zh": "咦？{$P$}先生，\n在下面走动的人们，是要从剧场回去的观众吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1017_p", "source_sha256": "aa0b087e94671e18d89e06c60b5e11d8df7ae014e517217ea4e4673cdceeadb4", "ja": "ん？　ああ、そうだよ。\n駅まで続く行列になっちゃってるな。", "zh": "嗯？是啊，没错。\n排成一条通往车站的队伍了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "c901e8147fd074b8409813d7f4a23a72aea2a33b97fb298326dad8ad8eb9e8f1", "ja": "でも、みんなニコニコして歩いてるみたいですね。\nなんだかうれしいです♪", "zh": "不过，大家脸上好像都带着笑容喔。\n让我也开心起来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "93a67f828e03b5e7dbe269f70b109eb41840069765ec0e64678f72c208598f45", "ja": "あ……、見てください！\nお客さん達もたくさん、空を見上げてます！", "zh": "啊……你看！\n也有好多观众抬头看着天空！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1020_p", "source_sha256": "de6c9e41469e5f75cf59b1cf6f4a5e5b12c9244869a396fbdc345fcd8ec3f4c3", "ja": "おっ、本当だ。……やっぱり星梨花の気持ちは、\nファンのみんなに届いてたんだな。", "zh": "喔！真的呢……\n看来粉丝们都有感受到星梨花的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3ae7f98ffb8bff41103a36709115ad3961eacd3dbc2580bfc559de702ffd7c3b", "ja": "みんな、星空を見て思い出してるんだよ。\nついさっきまで、星梨花達が……", "zh": "大家看到星空以后，\n一定都有回想起刚才星梨花你们的表演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1023_p", "source_sha256": "991ba1bd1de4559da65bd2fafec5f8dd6c5aa84c7ee7997302660ff1adf57254", "ja": "劇場でお星さまみたいに輝いていた、\n『Starlight Melody!』公演のステージを。", "zh": "那场在剧场里像星星一样闪耀的\n『Starlight Melody!』公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "d7bb318dbd48bf6d28ef6bdf025363b98eff6554a749f3c9fabbe4d7451e0758", "ja": "お星さまみたいな……ステージ……！", "zh": "像星星一样的……公演……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "f8ec1728683d1a9339bf6815ed05019307253ae560c632b0cb4416c505d027f4", "ja": "それじゃ、わたし達ほんとうに、お星さまみたいに\nキラキラできてたんですね！　えへへ、よかったです♪", "zh": "这么说，我们真的像星星一样在台上闪闪发亮了对吧！\n嘿嘿，太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "c788ccbf0c04bd1befd73a0ee1b87480eba816c9cb241c64b1720663720acae3", "ja": "……あっ。今、何人かの人がこっちを見て……。\n手をふってくれてます！　私も、ふってもいいですか？", "zh": "……啊，刚刚好像有几个人看向这边……\n他们挥手了！我也可以挥手吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1027_p", "source_sha256": "2a7ecb09bd01521228c580cd1c4f60e5dd1006ecdcbfcf03585fa6b1571b66c0", "ja": "いいけど……騒ぎになっても困るから、少しだけな。\nちゃんとご挨拶できたら、戻ろうか。", "zh": "是可以……但只能一下子喔，要是引起骚动就伤脑筋了。\n打完招呼后，我们就回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "211bfcf9bf0a48376da12e5b7456570f807db15be78129c29ac66a35ccb8d75e", "ja": "わかりました。……みなさーん！\n今日は本当に……ありがとうございましたー！", "zh": "我知道了……大家──！\n今天真的……非常谢谢你们──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0083_1029_p", "source_sha256": "47df288d59fdc5dffd1e24223936bed7e0508ea4d6dd1913e07866020124b137", "ja": "（見上げる空に輝く、まぶしいほど輝く笑顔。\n……きっと、みんなの記憶に残り続けることだろう）", "zh": "（抬起头就能看见，那挂在天空中的耀眼笑容……\n一定会永远留在大家的记忆中吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
